{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clapism</strong> is an incremental narrative game set in an empty church. A woman\u2019s voice drifts through the speakers, asking you to clap \u2014 just to test the sound...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153890/extras/cf112130bce5daebfd59957687ee55c1.poster.avif?t=1763821849\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153890/extras/cf112130bce5daebfd59957687ee55c1.webm?t=1763821849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153890/extras/cf112130bce5daebfd59957687ee55c1.mp4?t=1763821849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clap as loud as you want \u2014 you won\u2019t wake the neighbors.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A working boombox featuring tracks from independent artists such as <i>Emily Magpie</i> and </strong><strong><i>Mike Indest</i></strong><strong> to accompany your journey. No copyright music.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A rhythm of claps that becomes yours \u2014 and you\u2019ll keep clapping long after the story ends.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatic progress saving \u2014 explore at your own pace, no need to start over.</strong></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1000 claps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4153890/6bb8f88cd98f6f53310e5044bdefe004e8449fd7.jpg"},{"name":"2000 claps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4153890/0b937d9edc6ebd0f6f9eaf9091974e39dc9c5bf5.jpg"},{"name":"3000 claps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pub